ref_dict.prop:denseness:
\begin{proposition}\label{prop:denseness}
 Let $\A$ be an alphabet of size at least 2. In the class of minimal automatic systems over $\A$, amorphic complexity takes a dense set of values in $[1,\infty)$.   
\end{proposition}

